Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 15:26:34 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 36/39] glm cuda: sparse in-kernel merge with VEC8 (Mia 0068),
 KDA step2/4 (Mia 0084), batched shared/sharded decode (Mia 0075+0088 +
 L2-shared own+peer + skip unused give select), two-problem 6-stage glm_mm
 (Mia 0073), fused router+topk+group (Mia 0074 + MOE_DIRECT), and split HC
 finish/partial with PDL (Mia 0086+0089+0090, Apache-2.0)

